// Copy this file to Config/Signing.local.xcconfig and edit the copy.
// Signing.local.xcconfig is gitignored. Do not commit it, and do not put
// certificates, private keys, or provisioning profiles in it.
//
// Set to your 10-character Team ID, e.g. ABCDE12345.
// Xcode > Settings > Accounts, or developer.apple.com > Membership details.
// A free personal team or the paid team both work. Leave this empty until then.
LITTLEORBIT_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =

// Leave empty to keep app.littleorbit.ios, app.littleorbit.macos, and
// app.littleorbit.watchos. If a free personal team cannot register those
// IDs, set a unique suffix that includes the leading dot, for example
// .yourname. Profiles from a free personal team expire after 7 days.
LITTLEORBIT_BUNDLE_ID_SUFFIX =

// After LITTLEORBIT_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM is a real team, uncomment the next
// line so local Mac builds use your development certificate. Leave it
// commented to keep the shared ad-hoc Mac signature. Copying this file
// with an empty team and that line enabled fails the macOS build with
// "requires a development team".
// CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY[sdk=macosx*] = Apple Development
